# Styling

- Follow a single styling system consistently
- Prefer `StyleSheet.create` for styles
- Avoid large inline styles
- Keep styles close to components
- Prefer reusable spacing, radius and color tokens
- Avoid hardcoded colors and spacing values
- Prefer flex layouts over fixed dimensions
- Prefer semantic styling over one-off values
- Support light and dark themes
- Keep styling predictable and maintainable
